 status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.lem-tail-transfer"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.lem-tail-transfer"],"id":"long.lem-tail-transfer","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Lemma 6.53 (Changing finitely many support elements)","locator":"Long record Lemma 6.53, p. 59, label lem:tail-transfer","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $b\\ge2$ be an integer, and let $A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$. If $X_A(b)$ is irrational and $A,B$ have finite symmetric difference, then $X_B(b)$ is irrational too: the two sums differ by a finite sum of rational numbers. This observation supplies the finite modifications in Theorem 6.21.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.lem-tail-transfer","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.lem-tail-transfer","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.lem-tail-transfer%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSupportSeries_of_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.lem-tail-transfer%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSupportSeries_of_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSupportSeries_of_tail"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.lem-tail-transfer","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.lem-tail-transfer%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSupportSeries_tail_of_irrational%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sh